@startuml btrie-pure-bucket
' ============================================================================
' btrie-pure-bucket.puml — a pure bucket B^P: a SINGLE route from the parent
' trie; the shared leading prefix has been consumed (stripped from the strings).
' Source: docs/theory/disk-tries/02-b-trie.md (Askitis & Zobel 2009), § Bucket Types.
' Color key:  blue  #BBDEFB  parent trie node
'             green #C8E6C9  the pure bucket + its stored (prefix-stripped) strings
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #212121
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam TitleFontSize 15

title Pure bucket B^P('ab') — one route, leading prefix consumed

rectangle "**Parent Trie**   [a][b][c] … [z]\nexactly one slot routes here" as PT #BBDEFB
rectangle "**Pure Bucket  B^P('ab')**\nrange [*, *] (single char) · prefix consumed = 'ab'\n────────────\n'le'       (was 'able')\n'out'      (was 'about')\n'stract'   (was 'abstract')" as PB #C8E6C9

PT --> PB : single route

legend bottom
  Single route from root · leading char removed · a split grows the trie **vertically**.
endlegend
@enduml
